WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.808
The school asks you to explain what is normal, identify a meaningful change and choose the next action. This rehearsal follows those requirements using two new unfolding cases.
学校要求解释正常、识别有意义变化并选下一行动。本演练依这些要求，用两个新展开病例。

00:00:11.808 --> 00:00:24.720
Use the six earlier Week Seven lectures as tools rather than separate diagnosis lists. The same altered patient may need neurological, glucose, infection and pregnancy assessment together.
应把前六节第7周课当工具，而非分开的诊断单。同一意识变患者可能同时需神经、糖、感染及孕产评估。

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.872
The examples do not reproduce the school seventy-year-old stroke case or its twenty-eight-year-old maternal case. Their values are assumed training data, not patient observations or official assessment answers.
这些例不复制学校70岁卒中或28岁母体病例。数值是训练假设，不是真患者观察或官方考核答案。

00:00:37.872 --> 00:00:49.584
Practise saying what you found, what remains uncertain, what you will do and how you will reassess. Reading alone does not replace observed device practice or the school skill check.
需练说发现、未知、将做什么及如何复评。阅读不能替受观察器械练习或学校操作核查。

00:00:49.584 --> 00:01:02.568
Use anatomy and physiology to explain the deficit, altered fluid distribution or changed hormone response. The mechanism should predict a useful observation rather than merely add terminology.
用解剖生理解释缺损、液分布或激素反应。机制应预测有用观察，而不只添术语。

00:01:02.568 --> 00:01:14.784
Assessment readings explain how to obtain a reliable finding and compare it with baseline. A value loses meaning when technique, units, timing or the source of history is unclear.
评估阅读解释怎样取得可靠发现并与基线比。技术、单位、时刻或病史来源不清时，值就失意义。

00:01:14.784 --> 00:01:24.216
Drug and pathway readings connect the finding to permitted care. A hospital treatment paragraph does not give every responder authority to perform it.
药与路径阅读把发现连到获准照护。医院治疗一段，不给每种响应者操作权限。

00:01:24.216 --> 00:01:36.288
Mental-health and medical-surgical readings keep cognition, function, communication and longer-term needs visible. They help prevent a chronic diagnosis from hiding a new emergency.
精神及内外科阅读保认知、功能、沟通及长期需要可见，帮助防慢性诊断遮新急症。

00:01:36.288 --> 00:02:00.960
The school also links thirteen articles and one birth video outside its eleven-row textbook table. The article guides now sit inside the relevant maternal, neurological, toxic-renal, anaphylaxis and endocrine lectures. They explain the assigned material alongside deeper mechanisms and original cases, rather than treating each web page as a separate disconnected mini-course.
学校在十一行教材表外，还链接十三篇文章及一个分娩视频。文章指南现置于对应母体、神经、毒物肾脏、严重过敏及内分泌课内，结合较深入机制及原创病例解释，而不是把每个网页做成割裂的小课。

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:27.024
Keep source identity visible. The linked endocrine Part Two is specifically about hypothyroidism; the private birth video has not been reviewed, and normal birth is taught from the available article and connected birth lessons instead. Historical treatment details are reconciled with current local pathways. Learn why the finding matters, then explain the assessment, action, response and limit for this patient.
必须注明来源身份。所链接内分泌第二篇专讲甲低；私人分娩视频未能审阅，正常分娩改由可用指定文章及相连分娩课程教授。历史治疗细节须与现行当地路径核对。先学发现为何重要，再说明该患者的评估、行动、反应及界限。

00:02:27.024 --> 00:03:16.440
Use the additional anatomical terms as coordinates, not disconnected labels. The neuraxis bends between forebrain and cord, so dorsal/ventral orientation changes with region. The midbrain tectum is the aqueduct roof and includes colliculi; tegmentum lies ventrally and continues into wider brainstem circuitry. Superior colliculi support orientation, inferior colliculi auditory processing, and the medullary inferior olive contributes motor-learning circuits. A sulcus is a groove, a gyrus a ridge, and Brodmann areas are a microscopic cortical map. These landmarks refine an observed eye, sensory, movement or awareness change; they do not let a field examination prove one damaged nucleus.
把新增解剖词用作坐标，而非散标签：神经轴在前脑与脊髓间弯曲，背腹方向随区域改变；中脑顶盖tectum是导水管顶，含四叠体，腹侧被盖tegmentum延入更广脑干回路。上丘支持定向，下丘参与听觉，延髓下橄榄核参与运动学习回路；sulcus是沟，gyrus是回，Brodmann区是显微皮质图。这些地标细化眼动、感觉、运动或觉醒变化描述，不让现场检查证明某一核损伤。

00:03:16.440 --> 00:04:06.288
The actual glossary contains errors that would reverse a localization answer: precentral is frontal primary motor cortex; postcentral is parietal primary somatosensory cortex, not the swapped definitions printed there. Keep substantia nigra pars compacta as a dopaminergic modulator and pars reticulata with GPi as important inhibitory output, rather than substituting compacta in the indirect-output definition. Paravertebral ganglia are the sympathetic chain, not a second group superior to it; prevertebral ganglia lie anterior to the vertebral column. Thirty-one spinal nerves means thirty-one pairs, and a lateral white column contains sensory and motor tracts. These corrections agree with the preceding mechanisms; they are not a new instructor correction.
实际术语表有会把定位答案倒转的错误：中央前回是额叶初级运动皮质，中央后回是顶叶初级躯体感觉皮质，不是表中交换的定义。黑质致密部SNc保作多巴胺调节，网状部SNr与GPi是重要抑制输出，不能在间接通路输出定义把SNr换成SNc。椎旁节就是交感链，不是链上方另一组；椎前节位于椎柱前。三十一脊神经应指三十一对，外侧白质柱含感觉及运动束。这些纠正与前述机制一致，不冒称教师新指示。

00:04:06.288 --> 00:04:50.208
The actual autoimmune table reverses the Graves/Hashimoto receptor explanations. Graves typically involves stimulating TSH-receptor antibodies and excess thyroid-hormone production; Hashimoto involves autoimmune thyroid damage and commonly reduced production, not a universal receptor-stimulating mechanism. Temporary excess release can occur in an early destructive phase, so a simple high/low label is not a complete case assessment. The original immune/endocrine teaching above already uses the correct direction. Do not repeat the table error on an exam explanation, but preserve which source page differs rather than claiming the school issued a correction.
实际自身免疫表把Graves与桥本受体解释倒写：Graves通常涉及刺激性TSH受体抗体及甲状腺激素过多；桥本涉及自身免疫甲状腺损伤，常产量下降，不是普遍的受体刺激机制。破坏早期可短暂释放过多，因此简单高低标签不是完整病例评估。前述原创免疫及内分泌教学已用正确方向；解释考点时不能复制该表错误，但应保留哪张来源页不同，不声称学校发布了更正。

00:04:50.208 --> 00:05:43.992
Use mediator terms with their function, not a rigid distance rule: chemokines guide cell migration and are a cytokine group; cytokines coordinate responses over several spatial contexts. Histamine is one important vasoactive mast-cell mediator, not the sole cause of every allergy or anaphylaxis. Germinal centers support activated B-cell responses; chyle is lipid-rich intestinal lymph and the cisterna chyli feeds the thoracic-duct route. Graft-versus-host means donor immune cells attack recipient tissues, unlike recipient rejection of a graft. In an original transplant patient with confusion and rapid breathing, connect these mechanisms to infection risk and organ assessment without deciding that a normal temperature, one hormone history or a familiar diagnosis explains away deterioration.
介质术语要按功能，而非死记距离：趋化因子引细胞迁移，是细胞因子一类；细胞因子在多种空间背景协调反应。组胺是重要肥大细胞血管活性介质，不是每种过敏或过敏性反应的唯一原因。生发中心支持激活B反应，乳糜是富脂肠淋巴，乳糜池接胸导管路径；移植物抗宿主是供者免疫细胞攻受者，与受者排斥移植物不同。原创移植患者混乱快呼吸时，把机制连到感染风险及器官评估，不能用正常体温、一项激素史或熟悉诊断搪塞恶化。

00:05:43.992 --> 00:05:55.824
Before the station, check the actual devices, supplies and reference access. Confirm that the glucose display uses the units you will report and that the pressure cuff fits the patient.
站前需查真实器械耗材及参考访问，确认糖显示单位及袖带适配。

00:05:55.824 --> 00:06:07.104
Know who can provide advanced help and how to contact clinical consultation. A drug name on a worksheet does not replace the actual authorization, product or safety checks.
需知高级帮助是谁及如何临床咨询。工作纸药名不替真实授权、产品及安全核查。

00:06:07.104 --> 00:06:20.064
For tabletop practice, describe and simulate the planned action. Use training equipment under appropriate supervision rather than injecting, giving medicine or doing invasive practice on another student.
桌面练习应描述模拟计划，用训练器材及适当监督，不能对同学注射、给药或侵入练习。

00:06:20.064 --> 00:06:31.320
Keep the school observed checklist and the actual service protocol available. This course explains their reasoning but cannot certify a device skill that has not been observed.
需保学校观察表及真实机构流程可用。本课解释推理，但不能认证未被观察的器械技能。

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:42.480
Allocate tasks clearly while one person maintains overall priorities. Glucose testing, time questions and monitoring can often proceed in parallel with primary care.
需明确分工，一人维整体优先。查糖、问时间及监测常可与主要照护并行。

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:51.600
Use closed-loop communication for a critical task. Name the request, have the receiver acknowledge it and report the result with units and time.
关键任务需闭环：点请求、接者确认，再带单位时间报结果。

00:06:51.600 --> 00:07:02.400
A partner who notices inadequate breathing or new focal weakness should speak up immediately. Hierarchy must not hide a change while the leader finishes the history.
伙伴见呼吸不足或新局灶弱需立即说，不能因层级而等主导问完史才报。

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:12.000
Update the working picture after important findings. Everyone should know the immediate threat, destination concern and what will be reassessed next.
重要发现后需更新工作图景，所有人应知即时威胁、目的地担忧及下一复评。

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:23.352
Look for immediate airway, breathing and circulation threats before pursuing a neat diagnosis. A patient with shallow breathing does not wait for a complete stroke screen.
需先看即时气道呼吸循环威胁，再追整齐诊断。浅呼吸患者不能等完整卒中筛。

00:07:23.352 --> 00:07:35.688
Assess breathing depth and effectiveness as well as rate and oxygen saturation. Supplemental oxygen may improve the displayed saturation without correcting inadequate ventilation.
需评深度效能，也看次数血氧。给氧可升显示值，却未纠正通气不足。

00:07:35.688 --> 00:07:46.728
Check glucose early when the history or function suggests an altered state. Treat a credible low through the appropriate safe route while continuing the rest of the assessment.
史或功能提示意识变时应早查糖，依安全途径处理可信低值，同时继续其他评估。

00:07:46.728 --> 00:07:58.416
Reassess after a move, intervention or deterioration. A completed first pass is not proof that physiology will remain unchanged during the rest of the encounter.
移动、干预或恶化后需复评。做完首轮不证明后续生理不变。

00:07:58.416 --> 00:08:11.088
Address the patient first and adapt to language, hearing, vision or aphasia. Ask one question at a time and allow a response rather than treating difficulty speaking as refusal.
先对患者说，并适应语言听视或失语。一次一问留回应，不能把难说当拒绝。

00:08:11.088 --> 00:08:20.904
Ask a witness what was directly observed and the last normal interaction. Separate an estimate, a second-hand report and a documented time.
问目击者直接见什么及末次正常互动，需分估计、转述及有记录时间。

00:08:20.904 --> 00:08:31.344
Use medicines and relevant records to clarify risk, not to replace the clinical picture. A drug packet cannot tell you the last swallowed dose unless that is confirmed.
用药及相关记录澄风险，不替临床。药包不能在未确认时证明末次已吞时间。

00:08:31.344 --> 00:08:42.528
If information remains unknown, say so in the pre-alert and record. Do not invent a negative allergy, normal baseline or delivery date to complete a form.
未知需在预警记录如实说，不能为填表编无过敏、正常基线或分娩日。

00:08:42.528 --> 00:08:53.784
A sixty-two-year-old has new difficulty speaking and right-arm weakness. A companion last had a normal conversation at ten twelve, then found the change at ten forty.
一位62岁者新难说话及右臂弱。同行者10:12末次正常交谈，10:40发现变化。

00:08:53.784 --> 00:09:02.520
At ten forty-eight the crew measures glucose of three point zero. The actual onset between the two witness times is not known.
救护组10:48测糖3.0，两目击时刻间的真实起始未知。

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:13.320
Describe the current airway protection, breathing and perfusion rather than assume they are normal because this looks neurological. Begin appropriate support and early coordination.
需描述当前气道保护、呼吸及灌注，不能因像神经就假定正常。应开始适当支持及早协调。

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:22.560
The low is actionable, but it does not make the focal deficit irrelevant. Prepare to reassess the same functions after glucose correction.
低值需行动，却不使局灶无关。需准备纠糖后重评同功能。

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:34.656
Confirm the measured value and relevant technique, but do not create an unnecessary delay when a credible low matches serious symptoms. Simultaneously maintain primary support.
应确认测值及相关技术，但可信低值配严重症时不能无谓延误，同时维主要支持。

00:09:34.656 --> 00:09:43.968
A patient who cannot follow the required instructions or swallow safely should not receive loose food, fluid or gel into an unprotected airway.
不能遵所需指令或安全吞者，不可往无保护气道放散食、液或胶。

00:09:43.968 --> 00:09:57.816
Use the permitted non-oral pathway when eligible, with product, dose, access and reassessment checks. The earlier endocrine lecture explains the current local D ten and sealed nasal glucagon choices.
合条件时用获准非口服路径并核产品、量、通路及复评。此前内分泌课解释现行D10及密封鼻内胰高血糖素选择。

00:09:57.816 --> 00:10:08.424
Glucose-first is not a rule to delay ventilation, bleeding control or resource activation. It is an early diagnostic and treatment task within the whole encounter.
血糖优先不是延通气、止血或调资源规则，而是整体接触内早期诊疗任务。

00:10:08.424 --> 00:10:20.016
For this training branch, assume authorized glucose treatment was completed and documented. At ten fifty-one glucose is five point six and alertness is better.
本训练分支假设已完成并记录获准纠糖。10:51糖5.6且觉醒改善。

00:10:20.016 --> 00:10:30.912
The right arm still drifts and the patient still cannot name familiar objects as usual. Compare the actual repeat with the initial findings rather than write simply improved.
右臂仍漂移，仍不能像平常命名熟物。需把真实复查与初次比，不能只写改善。

00:10:30.912 --> 00:10:42.624
The low has been corrected, but the focal problem remains. Continue the stroke pathway and consider other concurrent causes without waiting for every symptom to become more dramatic.
低值已纠，局灶仍在。需继续卒中路径并考虑并存因，不能等全部更戏剧化。

00:10:42.624 --> 00:10:53.376
Even complete resolution would still need appropriate evaluation and recurrence assessment. It would not automatically prove that no stroke or transient vascular event occurred.
即使全消仍需适当评及复发评，不能自动证未发生卒中或短暂血管事件。

00:10:53.376 --> 00:11:02.304
Ten twelve is the last known well supported by this witness. Ten forty is the discovery time, not a substituted onset.
10:12是目击支持的最后正常，10:40是发现，不能替起始。

00:11:02.304 --> 00:11:13.416
Write who supplied the information and whether the earlier interaction confirmed usual speech and movement. A vague message that the patient was probably fine is weaker evidence.
需记谁提供，以及早前互动是否证平常言语运动。“大概没事”消息证据较弱。

00:11:13.416 --> 00:11:22.992
Preserve the treatment and repeat-assessment times separately. A receiving team needs to know both the original deficit and the state after correction.
治疗及复评时刻需另保。接收团队需知原缺损及纠后状态。

00:11:22.992 --> 00:11:32.784
Unknown onset does not remove urgency. Imaging-based selection and the regional pathway determine the definitive options, not an invented start time.
未知起始不消紧急，确定选项依影像筛及区域路径，而非编起始。

00:11:32.784 --> 00:11:43.536
In the repeat training assessment, right-arm drift remains and naming is abnormal. Record what happens during the actual task, not what you think the patient could do with coaching.
复训练评中右臂仍漂移，命名异常。需记真实任务表现，不是猜提示后可做什么。

00:11:43.536 --> 00:11:56.328
Complete both FAST and VAN as the checked local tool directs. For this branch, motor weakness with aphasia supports a positive VAN concern, even without another abnormal cortical item.
依核对本地工具完成FAST及VAN。本分支运动弱加失语，即使无另一皮质项异常，也支持VAN阳性担忧。

00:11:56.328 --> 00:12:09.288
Separate language impairment from slurred articulation, and account for baseline language or sensory needs. One unsuccessful English phrase in a non-English speaker is not automatically aphasia.
需分语言障碍与构音含糊，并顾基线语言感官。非英语者一句英语失败不自动失语。

00:12:09.288 --> 00:12:18.768
A negative screen cannot exclude every posterior, mild or atypical stroke. Continue reasoning from the complete current presentation.
筛阴不能排全部后循环、轻或非典型卒中，仍需依整体当前表现推理。

00:12:18.768 --> 00:12:28.440
Right-sided motor change with a language problem can fit a dominant-hemisphere process. That is a useful explanation, not a field angiogram.
右侧运动变加语言问题可符优势半球过程，这是有用解释，不是现场血管造影。

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:38.232
Do not name an exact occluded vessel, measure penumbra or rule out bleeding from this examination. Those claims require evidence beyond a screen.
不能凭此查命名精确闭塞血管、测半暗带或排血，这些需超量表证据。

00:12:38.232 --> 00:12:50.904
A seizure, migraine, toxin or systemic illness may mimic or coexist with vascular disease. A plausible alternative should widen assessment rather than cancel urgent care prematurely.
发作、偏头痛、毒或全身病可模拟或并存血管病。合理鉴别应扩大评估，不能过早取消急救。

00:12:50.904 --> 00:13:00.216
Document witnessed behavior and the recovery pattern without labeling a functional event from psychiatric history or one unusual movement.
需记目击行为及恢复模式，不能凭精神史或一次怪动贴功能性标签。

00:13:00.216 --> 00:13:13.032
Provide the support the current patient needs, including indicated oxygenation and adequate ventilation. Do not aggressively lower pressure or give a field stroke aspirin dose from an inpatient chapter.
需给当前所需支持，包括适应氧合及足够通气。不能强降压或照住院章给现场卒中ASA量。

00:13:13.032 --> 00:13:25.248
Protect the patient during movement and avoid an unsafe swallow. Do not delay urgent conveyance for a perfect history, a second ideal IV or repeated low-value testing.
移动时需保护并避不安全吞咽。不能为完美病史、第二理想IV或重复低价值测而延急转。

00:13:25.248 --> 00:13:35.208
Use the actual regional stroke pathway with stability and available resources. A generic comprehensive-centre label does not decide every destination.
需依稳定度及资源用真实区域卒中路径，通用综合中心标签不能定每次目的地。

00:13:35.208 --> 00:13:47.856
Pre-notification should communicate why the team is concerned and what has changed. The exact measured glucose and persistent deficit are more useful than a premature definitive diagnosis.
预警应说为何担忧及变什么。真实糖及持续缺损，比过早确定诊断更有用。

00:13:47.856 --> 00:14:02.160
Here is an original teaching structure: We have a sixty-two-year-old with persistent right-arm weakness and aphasia. Last confirmed well was ten twelve; the change was found at ten forty and onset is unknown.
原创教学结构可说：一位62岁者持续右臂弱及失语。末次确认正常10:12，10:40发现，起始未知。

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:17.040
Glucose was three point zero at ten forty-eight and is now five point six after authorized correction. Alertness improved, but the focal deficit remains. Both local screens have been completed with the findings reported.
10:48糖3.0，获准纠正后现5.6，觉醒改善但局灶仍在。两本地筛已完成并报告发现。

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:33.480
Then give the actual current breathing, perfusion, vital signs, medication details, relevant anticoagulant information and estimated arrival. In this exercise these missing values must remain unfilled until the station supplies them.
随后报真实当前呼吸灌注生命值、药细节、相关抗凝及预计到达。本练习未供值需留空，直到站点提供。

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:43.608
Use the local report format and receiving request. Do not state that a thrombolytic is guaranteed or omit a worsening airway while reciting the time line.
应依本地报告格式及接收要求，不能保证溶栓，或背时间线时漏恶化气道。

00:14:43.608 --> 00:14:54.960
For a second training round, change only one variable: the patient now develops a convulsive event during conveyance. Keep the earlier times and findings unchanged.
第二轮只改一个变量：转运中新出现惊厥。早前时间发现保持。

00:14:54.960 --> 00:15:04.776
Protect from injury without restraining the movement or forcing objects into the mouth. Time the actual event and support inadequate breathing promptly.
需护免伤，不压抽动或强塞物，计真实事件并及时支持呼吸不足。

00:15:04.776 --> 00:15:17.784
Repeat glucose and consider other current threats while coordinating the authorized advanced response. A seizure does not erase the possibility of stroke or create ordinary PCP benzodiazepine permission.
协调获准高级响应同时复糖并考其他威胁。发作不抹卒中可能，也不生普通PCP苯二氮䓬权限。

00:15:17.784 --> 00:15:28.224
Send the change and response to the receiving team. The original last-known-well remains a historical fact even while the current management priority changes.
需向接收报变化反应。即使当前优先改变，原最后正常仍是历史事实。

00:15:28.224 --> 00:15:40.344
A thirty-six-year-old is sixteen days after a cesarean birth. Recovery had been improving, but the support person reports new confusion and increasing incisional pain and redness.
一位36岁者剖宫产16天，原在恢复，支持者报新混乱及切口痛红加重。

00:15:40.344 --> 00:15:50.064
Temperature is thirty-eight point six, pulse one hundred sixteen and breathing twenty-four. Pressure is one hundred eighteen over seventy-four.
温38.6，脉116，呼吸24，压118/74。

00:15:50.064 --> 00:15:59.280
Room-air saturation is ninety-seven percent and glucose is six point two. These two values do not explain away the new loss of function.
室气血氧97%，糖6.2，这两值不能抹去新功能丧失。

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:09.960
This differs from the school case while rehearsing the same early-recognition and history problems. Start with the patient rather than wait for systolic pressure below ninety.
这与学校病例不同，但练同样早识别及病史问题。应先评本人，不能等收缩压低90。

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:22.344
Assess airway protection and effective breathing, then perfusion and mental function. A single blood pressure within a common range does not prove normal flow or exclude sepsis.
需评气道保护有效呼吸，再灌注意识。一次常见范围压不证正常流或排脓毒。

00:16:22.344 --> 00:16:33.744
Ask what the patient could do earlier today and what is different now. New inability to follow a simple conversation is more informative than the unqualified word confused.
问今天早先能做什么及现在不同。新跟不住简单对话，比未限定的混乱一词更有信息。

00:16:33.744 --> 00:16:44.952
Repeat observations after care and during movement. Report the trend and any falling responsiveness even if the original pressure has not become dramatically low.
照护及移动时需复观察，报趋势反应下降，即使原压未戏剧性变低。

00:16:44.952 --> 00:16:56.208
Possible infection with otherwise unexplained new dysfunction warrants early concern and urgent evaluation. The final source and diagnosis may still be uncertain.
可能感染加其他未解释新功能障碍需早担忧急评，最终源及诊断仍可能未知。

00:16:56.208 --> 00:17:08.160
In this original case, temperature, heart rate and respiratory rate satisfy the conventional SIRS observations used by the school exercise. The white-cell result is unknown.
本原创例温、脉及呼吸满足学校练习用的传统SIRS观察，白细胞未知。

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:18.120
Say three observed positive domains rather than four out of four. An unavailable laboratory result must not be assumed normal or abnormal.
应说观察到三项阳性，而非四项全阳。无化验不能假定正或异常。

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:31.800
SIRS describes a systemic inflammatory pattern and can occur without infection. Modern sepsis adds an infection-related dysfunctional host response with organ dysfunction, so the score is not the diagnosis.
SIRS描述全身炎性模式，可无感染。现代脓毒含感染相关失调宿主反应及器官障碍，因此分数不是诊断。

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:43.056
Do not wait for a full SIRS count, fever or shock threshold when credible deterioration is present. Maternal pathway and screening-population limits remain important.
可信恶化时不能等完整SIRS、发热或休克阈值。母体路径及筛查人群边界仍重要。

00:17:43.056 --> 00:17:55.248
Normal pregnancy adaptations do not make every postpartum abnormality physiological. Establish the actual recovery trajectory, recent function and delivery complications.
正常孕期适应不使每个产后异常都生理。需定真实恢复趋势、近期功能及分娩并发。

00:17:55.248 --> 00:18:07.464
The new confusion, fever and worsening wound symptoms are a meaningful change. A prior normal prenatal pressure does not exclude a separate postpartum hypertensive problem.
新混乱、热及伤口恶化是有意义变，孕期压曾正常不排另一个产后高压问题。

00:18:07.464 --> 00:18:16.368
Use the appropriate maternity escalation process. Do not apply a generic low NEWS score as proof that this postpartum patient is safe.
需用适当母体升级流程，不能用通用低NEWS证明该产后安全。

00:18:16.368 --> 00:18:27.576
Ask about birth or pregnancy loss even when the abdomen is not enlarged. Sensitive questions should be private, respectful and limited to information that affects care.
腹不大也应问分娩或孕丢失。敏感问题需私密尊重，并限影响照护信息。

00:18:27.576 --> 00:18:40.080
Ask about recent surgery, complications, discharge instructions and current medicines. Clarify antibiotic or analgesic use without assuming the medicine proves the diagnosis.
需问近期手术并发、出院指示及当前药，澄抗菌止痛用法，不能因药就证诊断。

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:52.392
Explore wound, pelvic, urinary, breast and respiratory symptoms as relevant. A red incision is a possible source but does not remove the need to assess other systems.
按需查切口盆腔、尿、乳房及呼吸症。红切口是可能源，不取消其他系统评。

00:18:52.392 --> 00:19:05.448
Ask about bleeding, severe headache, visual change, chest symptoms and breathlessness. These can redirect priorities toward hemorrhage, hypertensive disease or cardiopulmonary complications.
需问出血、严重头痛、视变、胸症及气促，可把优先导向血、高压病或心肺并发。

00:19:05.448 --> 00:19:18.312
If confusion prevents reliable answers, obtain attributed collateral and relevant documents while continuing care. Unknown blood loss or an uncertain medication time stays uncertain.
混乱不能可靠答时，继续照护同时取标来源旁证及相关文书。未知丢血或药时仍保未知。

00:19:18.312 --> 00:19:30.144
A meaningful differential explains what evidence supports the leading problem and what dangerous alternative still needs checking. It is not a long list spoken after the decision is already fixed.
有意义鉴别要讲支持主问题证据及仍需查的危险替代，不是决定已死后背长单。

00:19:30.144 --> 00:19:42.840
Infection is plausible here, but active bleeding, hypertensive neurological disease, thromboembolism, cardiomyopathy or a metabolic problem may coexist or better explain new findings.
此处感染合理，但活动血、高压神经病、栓塞、心肌病或代谢可并存，或更好解释新发现。

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:58.152
The school mentions ectopic pregnancy as a safety check. Do not mechanically force it onto a verified sixteen-day postpartum history; clarify whether the reported pregnancy event was actually a birth, current pregnancy or loss.
学校提异位妊娠作安全查，但不能机械套已核分娩16天。需澄所谓孕事件究竟分娩、当前妊娠还是丢失。

00:19:58.152 --> 00:20:08.688
For each relevant branch identify one useful observation and the action it would change. Then return to current breathing, perfusion and the transport plan.
每相关分支应指一个有用观察及会改的行动，再回当前呼吸灌注转运计划。

00:20:08.688 --> 00:20:21.168
In the next practice round, add one fact: the support person reports fresh heavier vaginal bleeding while the crew prepares to move. Do not rewrite the earlier wound or fever findings.
下一轮只加一事：准备移动时支持者报新更重阴道血。不能改写早前伤口热发现。

00:20:21.168 --> 00:20:32.040
Clarify the real amount and timing and assess current perfusion. A pad description is useful history but does not measure every concealed or previous blood loss.
需澄真实量时并评当前灌注。垫描述有用，却不能量全部隐性或既往丢失。

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:43.848
Infection and hemorrhage can coexist. Do not demand that a patient fit only one station diagnosis before using the appropriate maternal escalation and urgent conveyance.
感染出血可并存，不能非要只符一个站诊断才用母体升级急转。

00:20:43.848 --> 00:20:55.416
Update the receiving team with the new fact and current response. Do not stand an unwell patient to provoke orthostatic symptoms or perform an unauthorized examination.
需报新事及当前反应，不能让不稳者站起诱体位症或做未获准检查。

00:20:55.416 --> 00:21:07.392
Support the current physiological threat and reassess frequently. A high oxygen number does not replace breathing assessment, and a normal glucose does not remove a neurological problem.
需支持当前生理威胁并频繁复评。高血氧不替呼吸，正常糖不消神经问题。

00:21:07.392 --> 00:21:20.520
Use the actual authorized fluid and medication plan, assessing response and overload risk. Do not copy a large inpatient sepsis total or specialist obstetric regimen into a PCP station.
需用真实获准液药计划并评反应过负荷，不能把住院大量总液或专科产科方案套PCP站。

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:32.256
Arrange urgent evaluation and early notification without waiting for shock. Antibiotics and source control require the appropriate clinical team and established program.
应不等休克就急评及早预警，抗菌控源需适当团队及既定项目。

00:21:32.256 --> 00:21:43.752
Explain the concern to the patient and support person in clear language. Preserve appropriate privacy, comfort, thermal care and dignity while organizing movement.
需用清楚语言向本人支持者解释担忧，组织移动同时保隐私、舒适、温度及尊严。

00:21:43.752 --> 00:21:58.344
An original teaching opening is: We have a thirty-six-year-old sixteen days after cesarean delivery, with new confusion and worsening incisional pain and redness. We are concerned about infection-associated deterioration.
原创教学开头可说：36岁剖宫产16天，新混乱及切口痛红加重，担忧感染相关恶化。

00:21:58.344 --> 00:22:11.256
Give the measured temperature, pulse, breathing rate, pressure, oxygen context and glucose with times. State that the pressure is currently preserved rather than call the patient stable.
需带时刻报温脉呼吸压、给氧背景及糖。应说目前压保留，而非称稳定。

00:22:11.256 --> 00:22:24.360
Report any new bleeding, relevant negative findings only when actually assessed, and history gaps that may affect the receiving plan. Do not invent normal uterine findings or a negative clot history.
需报新出血、仅真实评过的相关阴性及影响接收计划的病史缺口。不能编子宫正常或无血栓史。

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:38.496
Close with support provided, response, additional help, actual destination and estimated arrival. Ask for the appropriate receiving or consultation plan rather than promise a final diagnosis.
结尾报已支持、反应、额外帮助、真实目的地及预计到达，求适当接收咨询计划，而不保证最终诊断。

00:22:38.496 --> 00:22:50.568
A patient who becomes quieter may be deteriorating rather than settling. Repeat attention, response and breathing instead of assuming that less agitation means improvement.
变安静可在恶化而非平静。需复注意、反应及呼吸，不能把少激越认改善。

00:22:50.568 --> 00:23:03.216
The PMHN reading distinguishes delirium from chronic cognitive impairment. Acute fluctuating inattention can coexist with dementia, medical illness or a psychiatric diagnosis.
PMHN阅读分谵妄及慢性认知障碍，急性波动注意差可并痴呆、躯体或精神诊断。

00:23:03.216 --> 00:23:16.656
Use a calm environment, sensory aids and simple explanations while assessing causes. De-escalation is compatible with urgent medical care and does not justify leaving the person unobserved.
需平静环境、感官辅助及简单解释，同时查因。降级与急救相容，不支持独留。

00:23:16.656 --> 00:23:27.864
Capacity is decision-specific and time-specific. A diagnosis, low cognitive score or relative presence does not automatically authorize someone else to decide.
能力针对特定决定时刻，诊断、低认知分或亲属在场不自动授权别人决定。

00:23:27.864 --> 00:23:38.232
After an intervention, state what actually changed. Glucose rose, breathing became deeper or the patient could answer a question are different observations.
干预后应说真实变什么。糖升、呼吸更深或能答问题，是不同观察。

00:23:38.232 --> 00:23:48.240
Then compare with the desired effect. A better number without restored function may indicate incomplete response, recurrence or a second problem.
再比预期效应。数字好而功能未回，可能不全、复发或第二问题。

00:23:48.240 --> 00:24:02.400
Actively look for harm, including inadequate ventilation, worsening perfusion, extravasation, overload or new symptoms relevant to the intervention. Do not document no adverse effect without checking.
需主动查相关害，如通气不足、灌注差、外渗、过负荷或新症。未查不能记无不良。

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:11.784
Use the findings to choose the next action and communicate it. Repeating the original treatment simply because it was first chosen is not reassessment.
需以发现选下一行动并沟通。只因最初选过就重复，不是复评。

00:24:11.784 --> 00:24:23.448
Use the applicable local transfer format and identify what is new since the pre-alert. The receiving clinician needs the current patient, not only the initial chief complaint.
需用适用本地交接格式并标预警后新变。接收者需当前患者，不只初主诉。

00:24:23.448 --> 00:24:35.208
Give actual measurements with units and times, including oxygen conditions and repeat neurological findings. Separate reported blood loss or symptoms from measured observations.
需带单位时刻给实测，含氧背景及复神经，并分自报血量症与测观察。

00:24:35.208 --> 00:24:49.920
Medication details include the actual product, dose, route, time and observed response, plus relevant prior patient or caregiver doses. Do not omit a failed access or treatment problem that affects the next team.
药细节含真产品、量途时及已见反应，也含相关先前本人照护者量。影响下队的失败通路治疗问题不能漏。

00:24:49.920 --> 00:25:00.360
Preserve unknowns and the source of collateral. Complete the record from the actual encounter rather than reconstruct a perfect-looking story after the event.
需保未知及旁证来源，依真实接触完成记录，不能事后重建看似完美故事。

00:25:00.360 --> 00:25:09.144
Run the first round from scene approach to pre-alert using only the initial facts. Speak your priorities and ask for the observations you need.
首轮只用初始事实，从接近到预警，需说优先并索需要观察。

00:25:09.144 --> 00:25:19.968
In round two add one finding, such as persistent aphasia after glucose correction or new bleeding in the postpartum case. Explain how it changes the working plan.
第二轮只加一项，如纠糖后失语持续或产后新血，解释如何改工作计划。

00:25:19.968 --> 00:25:30.984
In round three introduce an intervention response or deterioration. Assess it before the facilitator offers another diagnosis, so the reasoning remains visible.
第三轮加干预反应或恶化，在主持给另一诊断前评，让推理可见。

00:25:30.984 --> 00:25:41.088
Repeat the missed step rather than restart a different unrelated case. The aim is a reliable clinical sequence, not memorizing one ideal script.
需重练漏步，不是另开无关病例。目标是可靠临床序列，不是背一个理想剧本。

00:25:41.088 --> 00:25:52.824
Give feedback about what was observed: the crew maintained ventilation while a partner checked glucose, or the report preserved an unknown onset. Avoid vague good or bad labels.
反馈应针对已见，如查糖同时维通气，或报告保未知起始，避免空泛好坏。

00:25:52.824 --> 00:26:05.424
For the maternal case, check that abnormal function was recognized before shock and that SIRS was counted honestly. A correct infection label does not excuse an unsafe swallow or ignored bleeding.
母体例需查休克前认异常及诚实计SIRS。感染标签对，不抵不安全吞咽或忽略血。

00:26:05.424 --> 00:26:15.744
Choose one measurable improvement, such as repeating focal findings after treatment or stating the source of the last-known-well time. Then repeat that moment.
需选一可测改善，如治疗后复局灶或说最后正常来源，再重练该刻。

00:26:15.744 --> 00:26:26.544
Separate a tabletop success from observed equipment competence or official school acceptance. Record what was practised and what still needs instructor observation.
需分桌面成功、已观察器械能力及官方学校通过。应记练什么及仍需教师看什么。

00:26:26.544 --> 00:26:36.096
You should be able to connect a new symptom to the relevant normal physiology and explain at least one dangerous alternative without losing the immediate priority.
应能把新症连相关正常生理，解释至少一个危险鉴别，同时不丢即时优先。

00:26:36.096 --> 00:26:46.704
Demonstrate the assessment sequence using the actual school tools and supervised equipment. State the operator and consultation boundaries for the proposed treatment.
需用真实学校工具及监督器材演评序，并说明拟治疗操作者及咨询边界。

00:26:46.704 --> 00:26:58.368
After every meaningful change, reassess function and physiology and communicate the effect. A correct initial diagnosis is not enough when the patient evolves.
每有意义变后需复功能生理并沟通效应，患者变化时初诊正确不足。

00:26:58.368 --> 00:27:08.784
Use the bilingual assigned-reading guides to close the mechanism and terminology gaps, then retest the original case with new data rather than memorize the school assessment.
需用双语指定阅读补机制术语缺口，再以新数据重测原创病例，而非背学校考核。
